# Line endings are normalized to LF: in the repository, in every working tree,
# on every platform. The project used to carry a CRLF/LF mix inherited from its
# Windows + qmake years; 4.0 unified it (see doc/ROADMAP-3.x.md, decision K20).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts run on POSIX hosts, including CI.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets. Declared explicitly so they are never inspected as text.
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
